<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-BANK NIAGA FIRST HALF NET UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BANK NIAGA FIRST HALF NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in billion rupiah except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    Net profit			63.53	  vs    43.48</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)    336	    vs    276</p>
<p>    Net interest income	   200.79	 vs   156.71</p>
<p>    Other operating income	 45.15	 vs    40.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   88.64	 vs    60.00</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     299.67	 vs   204.31</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Bank Niaga is among Indonesia's largest privately-owned banks.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
